# ============================================================
# NOT IGNORED (intentionally tracked in this repository):
#
#   hybrid_ctc_model.pth   — trained model weights, required to run
#   ctc_vocab.json         — character vocabulary, required to run
#   Testing_Images/        — sample images for demonstration
#   index.html             — web UI
#   style.css              — web UI styling
#   script.js              — web UI logic
#   main.py                — FastAPI backend
#   TrainingScript_0.ipynb — training experiment notebook
#   TrainingScript_1.ipynb — final training notebook
#   Testing.ipynb          — evaluation notebook
# ============================================================

